# ::tok This large - scale delegation of 100 people from Hong Kong included leaders and supervisors of tourism - related departments of the Hong Kong government , more than 60 representatives from travel agencies and cross - border transportation operators from Hong Kong and Macao , as well as about 30 journalists from travel magazines and newspapers , representatives of social media and online media , as well as bloggers / Internet celebrities , who visited Macao for exchanges and visits to learn about the latest tourism resources in Macao . The Hong Kong industry and media brought new ways of tourism in Macao to Hong Kong residents and visitors , taking advantage of the advantages of Hong Kong 's transportation hub to expand the " online travel " market between Hong Kong and Macao by expanding the Hong Kong and Macao " online travel " market .
