# ::tok Xinhua News Agency , Beijing , Feb. 10 ( Xinhua ) . Members , alternate members of the newly appointed Central Committee and key leading cadres at the provincial and ministerial levels studied and implemented Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era and the spirit of the 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China . On the afternoon of the 10th , they graduated from the Central Party School ( State Administration College ) . Cai Qi , a member of the Standing Committee of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and secretary of the Central Secretariat , attended the closing ceremony and made concluding remarks as a concluding speech .
