# ::tok Personally , I think it 's acceptable . First , the price is cheap , and more than 700 pages are divided into two books . As a paperback book , it 's better to read it . Second , unlike Michelangelo 's Complete Works , paintings account for the main body . Leonardo da Vinci 's black - and - white manuscript accounts for the majority . For readers with limited budgets and non - art majors , this edition is the highest cost - effective for appreciating paintings and manuscripts . The highest cost - effectiveness of appreciation works and manuscripts is the highest .
